# Kickoff Celebrations: "Max speed - Sacrifice this enchantment: Creatures and Vehicles you control gain haste until end of turn." Bot1's speed is 1 from
# the enchantment on turn 1 and a Memnite hit raises it on turns 3, 5 and 7 (2, 3, then 4). Below max speed (turn 5, speed 3) the sacrifice is not
# offered. At max speed in turn 7's second main phase it is: Bot1's Memnite (a creature) and Smuggler's Copter (a Vehicle that is no creature) gain haste;
# Bot1's Mox Ruby and Bot2's Ornithopter and Smuggler's Copter do not (not "you control", not a creature or Vehicle). An Ornithopter Bot1 casts afterwards
# does not either (CR 611.2c). On turn 9 the Memnite no longer has haste ("until end of turn").

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Kickoff Celebrations
Memnite
Smuggler's Copter
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Smuggler's Copter
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kickoff Celebrations.Cast
Bot1.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
Bot2.Block()
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Speed = 2
! Bot1.Battlefield.Kickoff Celebrations.Activate
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
Bot2.Block()
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Speed = 3
! Bot1.Battlefield.Kickoff Celebrations.Activate
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
Bot2.Block()
[T7 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Speed = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Kickoff Celebrations.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Kickoff Celebrations
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Haste
? Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Keywords = Flying; Haste
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
? Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Keywords = Flying
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
[T9 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Graveyard = Kickoff Celebrations
